# Brewfile — single source of truth for CLI/terminal packages on any Mac.
# Installed on every machine, including headless ones (./sync.sh --no-gui).
# Install/update with: brew bundle --file=Brewfile
# (or just run ./sync.sh, which calls this for you)
#
# GUI apps live in Brewfile.gui instead, so they can be skipped on
# terminal-only machines (e.g. a headless Mac mini).

